---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
  title: 'Legal notice | tevsys',
  description: 'tevsys legal notice. Intellectual property, ownership and general conditions.',
};
---

<Layout seo={seo} lang="en">
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>

    <h2>Ownership</h2>
    <p>tevsys™ is a software product developed independently, with no external investors, based in Barcelona (Spain).</p>
    <p>All technology, design, operating logic, documentation and audiovisual content published on this website is the intellectual property of its creators.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The tevsys™ trade name, its logo, the architecture of the Expert Advisor (EA) for MetaTrader 5, the risk-control algorithms (HyperClose, SML, millimetric precision) and all associated technical documentation are protected by intellectual property rights.</p>
    <p>Reproduction, distribution or modification in whole or in part without express written authorization is prohibited.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>tevsys is a risk-management and operational-discipline tool. It does not constitute financial advice, investment advice or a trading recommendation. The user is solely responsible for their trading decisions.</p>

    <h2>Document in development</h2>
    <p>This legal notice will be expanded and reviewed with professional legal advice before the commercial launch of the product. For any legal enquiry, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@tevsys.io">info@tevsys.io</a>.</p>

    <p class="legal-update">Last updated: January 2026</p>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-update {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
